      "value": "@{68b7a5c7ce2ca2b520d2e571|full_name} It is against vrchat TOS to do exactly that. and vrchat is VERY strict on this as it will get you banned for months the moment you add it to your world. it is possible to do it without udon already, but not with udon. Reasons to do this with udon is things like blacklisting users who use clients or cheat. while cheating and using a client in a single person game is fine, multi-player is not ok.",
